            <ArticleTitle>Varicocele: A Review.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>170-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1055/s-0036-1586147</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Varicoceles are relatively common clinical problem that are associated with pain, testicular atrophy, and reduced fertility rates. After a brief historical perspective is presented, this article reviews the anatomy, indications, treatment options, and potential complications related to varicoceles.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
